      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、启动后台子任务"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一启动后台子任务"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "在命令后加 & 操作符，表示将命令放在子 shell 中异步执行，可达到多线程效果："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "sleep 10      # 同步：等待 10 秒，再继续下一操作\nsleep 10 &    # 异步：当前 shell 不等待，由后台子 shell 执行"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、wait 命令"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二wait-命令"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "wait [作业指示或进程号]"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "规则："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "等待指定作业/进程退出，返回其退出状态；不指定参数则等待所有子进程退出，退出状态为 0"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "shell 顶层使用 wait 不会等待函数中启动的子任务；在函数内部使用则只等待函数内启动的后台任务"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "shell 中使用 wait 相当于高级语言里的多线程同步"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、示例"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三示例"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.1 等待所有子任务结束"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "31-等待所有子任务结束"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/bin/bash\nsleep 10 &\nsleep 5&\nwait   # 等待所有后台任务，约 10 秒后退出"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.2 等待指定子进程"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "32-等待指定子进程"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/bin/bash\nsleep 10 &\nsleep 5&\nwait $!   # $! 表示上个子进程的进程号；此例等待 sleep 5，约 5 秒后退出"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "3.3 在函数中使用 wait"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "33-在函数中使用-wait"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/bin/bash\nsource ~/.bashrc\n\nfun(){\n    echo \"fun is begin.timeNum:$timeNum\"\n    local timeNum=$1\n    sleep $timeNum &\n    wait    # 只等待本函数中 wait 前的 sleep\n    echo \"fun is end.timeNum:$timeNum\"\n}\n\nfun 10 &\nfun 20 &\n\nwait   # 若 fun 内没有 wait，整个脚本立刻退出，不会等待 fun 里面的 sleep\necho \"all is ending\""
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "输出结果："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "fun is begin.timeNum:10\nfun is begin.timeNum:20\nfun is end.timeNum:10\nfun is end.timeNum:20\nall is ending"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "两个函数并行执行，wait 使脚本等待所有子任务完成才退出。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
